### Variable Definitions
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3309/api/products
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Get Product by ID (ES with MySQL Fallback)
GET {{baseUrl}}/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 2. Search Products - Full Text Search & Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?query=phone&category=Electronics&brand=Apple&inStock=true&minPrice=100.00&maxPrice=1500.00&page=0&size=20&sortBy=price&sortDirection=ASC
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 3. Search Products - Minimal Query
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?query=laptop
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 4. Search Products - Cursor Pagination (searchAfter)
# Replace 'searchAfter' value with the 'nextSearchAfter' token returned from a previous query response
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?query=phone&size=10&sortBy=price&sortDirection=ASC&searchAfter=eyJzb3J0VmFsdWVzIjpbOTk5Ljk5LCJpZC0xMjMiXX0=
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 5. Create / Index Product (POST example)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Wireless Noise-Canceling Headphones",
  "description": "High-fidelity audio with active noise cancellation.",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "brand": "AudioTech",
  "price": 299.99,
  "inStock": true,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}